@startuml
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

participant "Server" as S
participant "Broadcast (All Clients)" as B

== NewEraState Entry ==

S ->> B: onPhaseChanged(phase: PhaseType.NEW_ERA)

note over S: Server notifies PhaseObservers\nBuildingEffects with NEW_ERA effects activate

loop for each active BuildingEffect (PhaseObserver)
    S ->> B: onPlayerResourceChanged(nickname: String, resource: String, newValue: int, delta: int)
end

note over S: NewEraState.onEntryActions() triggered

== New Era Preparation ==

note over S: executeNewEraPreparation()

S ->> B: onEraChanged(newEra: Era, newUpperRowBuildings: List<String>, newLowerRowBuildings: List<String>, discardedBuildings: List<String>)

== Transition to TotemPlacementState ==

S ->> B: onTurnOrderEstablished(turnOrder: List<String>)

S ->> B: onPhaseChanged(phase: PhaseType.TOTEM_PLACEMENT, currentPlayer: String)

note right S: Transition to TotemPlacementState
@enduml